WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:21.500
Where are we?

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.960
What are you doing?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.990
Is that you, stupid Kouga brats?!

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:49.400
That isn't fair!

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:52.220
He's the one not being fair, wearing armor!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:55.400
You little...

00:00:58.530 --> 00:00:59.660
No kunai.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.910
I didn't tell you to kill each other.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:07.170
You're going to fight together and train.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.090
But it isn't for the sake of the Kouga.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.750
Nor for the Iga.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:16.080
It is all for the sake of our leaders.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.570
That girl?

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.790
She's going to be our leader?

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:02.210
Let's test her.

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:03.910
They said no kunai.

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:05.530
I won't hit her.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.410
I just want to see her frightened.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.700
She senses her enemies' antagonism 
and neutralizes it.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:46.580
That is the eye magic of the Five 
Flowers of Iga's leader, Iga Hibiki.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.380
Eye Shield Magic.

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.700
A little girl like that?

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:53.230
Then, he's...

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.270
Hachirou?

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:01.340
Wait, Saizou!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:22.490
What was that?

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.580
You almost died.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.610
Even if you intended to miss,

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.450
even the slightest intent to kill...

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:34.500
Hachirou's eyes turn that antagonism 
back upon the enemy.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:46.510
<b><i>The Kouga Must Die</i></b>

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.520
Calm down, Hibiki.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.720
You're being selfish, Hachirou!

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:58.480
Utsutsu, Hachisu, Rui... 
Why do you think they're here?

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.770
Saizou, Shichigen, Shikibu, too...

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.470
I know.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:06.840
I may be betraying them all.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.280
Then let's try it.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.030
Try it?

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:12.230
If this is our end,

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:17.440
then let's see what awful things 
our eye magic can do!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.480
Kazuma!

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.120
Kazuma, where are you?

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.550
What happened, Kazuma?!

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:30.930
Did you hear?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.560
His Heaven's Lyre.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:37.720
If the Heaven's Lyre plays, it means 
his opponent is surely dead!

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:49.090
Kazuma...

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.350
Don't die on us, Kazuma!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.630
Kasou...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:03.820
Right.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:05.550
I'll get you off that thing!

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:08.600
Kasou, did you hear that?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:13.170
My ultimate technique, the Heaven's Lyre.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.640
I'm about to hear its true melody.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.320
Now, listen to it with me,

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:25.280
the melody of the completed Heaven's Lyre...

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:26.930
No, Kazuma!

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:27.530
No...

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:04.230
Such is the fate of the ninjas.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:09.700
To offer their lives to devils, in pursuit 
of their techniques' completion.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:13.670
Their desire knows no bounds.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.570
You killed Tenshin and Kazuma?

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:21.830
But even if one were to master such a trick,

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.190
it would be a mere child's trick,

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:29.090
fit for no more than removing one's own head.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.100
How ephemeral, how sad...

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.160
Kusanagi Kazuma.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:39.610
He ended his life as a big 
fish in a small pond.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:40.330
Wha—

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:40.880
Wait!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.350
Who are you?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:47.450
Etiquette demands that one names oneself

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.640
before asking another's name.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.350
Well, in fact,

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:58.870
I am well aware that you are the 
famous Five Treasures of Kouga.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.740
The Five Treasures?

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:05.470
It seems that one is missing...

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:09.130
Yes, isn't your leader Kouga Hachirou?

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:12.090
He is still a child.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.890
Did he get scared and run?

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:16.270
Die!

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.160
Kasou, wait.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.180
Kasou...

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:01.680
<i>No... It's impossible!</i>

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:06.060
How about that?

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.260
Your name...

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.070
Give me your name!

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.110
The Joujinshuu...

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.360
Not that you would know it, 
even with my telling you.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:20.580
But I am one of them, Kujaku Tsuibamu.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.450
I don't understand.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:27.830
Why would the Joujinshuu 
rise against the Kouga?!

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:31.340
I don't know if it will 
help to tell you this.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:37.590
But we aren't simply the Five 
Treasures of Kouga's enemies.

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:38.830
What?

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:43.780
The Five Flowers of Iga 
will also die tonight.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:45.100
Nonsense.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.600
You cannot yet tell if it's nonsense or not?

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:52.670
Or have you realized that your death is nigh,

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:57.490
and has the fear robbed you of your reason?

00:09:57.770 --> 00:10:01.740
I'm afraid I'm too old to fear death!

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:05.420
Aging is a sad thing...

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:07.700
You may act as strong as you like,

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.500
but you cannot hide the thick 
sweat on your forehead.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:16.080
There's no further call to speak, correct?

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.380
Indeed.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.890
Very well, then!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:27.590
Let's see you finish me off, too...

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.650
If you can!

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:37.680
You are a fool, Kujaku Tsuibamu!

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.840
My technique, the Firefly Squid,

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:42.590
does not release only light.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:45.910
You failed to realize it holds 
a deadly poison, as well!

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:51.570
What?

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:54.890
Which of us is the fool?

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:56.920
Wh-Why didn't it work?

00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:00.720
I don't know if it's Firefly 
Squid or a common squid.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:05.080
But in the end, no poison can 
work without contact...

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.240
There's no cause for surprise.

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:13.690
Even the Kurokuwa shinobi 
were capable of flight...

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:18.270
Which ninja line are the Joujinshuu from?!

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:19.190
Ninja?

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:23.890
We are not like you poor creatures,

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:26.950
who can only serve their 
lord and live in secret.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:27.990
What?

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:33.120
The longer the Tokugawas flourish, 
and that the peace lasts,

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:35.840
the less need there is for ninjas.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.220
Perhaps this is a joyous thing for you,

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:42.840
to die before you see the end of the ninjas.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.530
Enough with your nonsense!

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.100
Oh, my!

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:01.820
A strange sight, is it not?

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:06.000
The light from my sweat derives from 
the fact that, since childhood,

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.850
I've filled my body with 
many different poisons.

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:12.760
This is the power of a ninja's technique!

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:19.300
A light gained after great effort, 
pain, and suffering!

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:41.960
So I...

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:45.030
I was right?

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:52.040
I guess you figured it out?

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:52.960
Indeed.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:55.980
The flow of time

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:58.280
went backwards.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:07.270
Time went... backwards?

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.480
Impossible.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:13.240
Such a technique is impossible...

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.370
Oh, dear!

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.860
You noticed, but refuse to admit it?

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:22.810
That stubbornness will destroy you.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.360
<i>Impossible.</i>

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:30.000
It truly is a happy thing,

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.130
death by the coursing of your poison.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:37.880
Well, die slowly, then.

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:07.170
<i>Forgive me for dying with 
my task unfulfilled.</i>

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.690
What's wrong?

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.700
I heard Gei'in's voice!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.790
Gei'in... No, the Five Treasures have died!

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.940
I heard his voice...

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.240
They were all defeated!

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:23.220
I'll go on ahead!

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.550
The Five Treasures died?

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:31.180
I hope that I'm wrong.

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:35.180
No, if that was how it seemed 
to you, then you were right.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:38.190
The Five Treasures are now dead.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.190
But by whose hand?

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.560
If all four were defeated,

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:47.190
the enemy is very skilled,
or came in great numbers.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.920
Either way,

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:53.080
the Five Treasures would not be defeated 
without much preparation.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:56.270
So they were the target from the beginning?

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:57.620
Then, next...

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.820
Most likely, yes.

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:03.960
Hachirou, I cannot let you go now.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.220
With the Five Treasures gone,

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.220
I cannot go against their will.

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:15.280
Wait.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:17.390
Wait!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.980
First, the Five Flowers of 
Iga must be informed.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.980
I don't want the Iga to avenge us.

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:27.460
At your age, what can you do?

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:30.820
Let us leave it to Rui.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.460
She is the fastest.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:36.380
But if we're telling the Five Flowers, 
I, their leader, should...

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:39.000
You have to stay here, Hibiki.

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:40.750
For our sake.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:46.030
Anyway, I don't know if the Five 
Treasures are really dead,

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.760
but do we need the Iga to help?

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.010
You're still talking that way?

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:53.700
The Kouga and Iga share a fate.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:58.200
Yesterday, Kazuma seriously tried to kill me.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.440
He got what he deserved.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:00.410
Utsutsu!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:03.640
It was because you interfered.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.030
But did he have to go that far?!

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.780
Utsutsu, you have it out for them too much.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.290
They're not that bad.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:12.450
You didn't realize it, Rui?

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:17.440
That Shichigen guy looks harmless,

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:21.310
but whenever he has a free second, 
he's staring at your boobs.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.890
He wants to get his hands on them.

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:25.840
What?

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:29.090
Why do we have to keep hanging 
out with these guys?

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.680
Enough, Utsutsu!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:34.190
Whether we avenge the Kouga or not,

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:35.680
we must do our jobs.

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:39.640
That's why we were brought 
here. For times like these.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.320
I'm counting on you.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:52.190
Shichigen, fulfill the duty 
you volunteered for.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.940
Stay close.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:19.490
We don't know when the enemy will appear.

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.130
Hey, can't you hear me?

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:23.490
Yes.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.980
Then, don't lower your guard.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.500
<i>That's why my guard's up.</i>

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:30.740
<i>The enemy may be closer than I expect.</i>

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:45.120
I'll send my eyes up.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:48.220
You... Hmm, watch to the north—

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:49.850
Do not give me orders!

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:52.090
I will decide where I'll look.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.900
That's creepy, no matter how often I see it.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.990
And it's inconvenient, too.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.110
It lets you see far away,

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.680
but it leaves your eyes and body wide open.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.630
What if you lose your eyes?

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.060
I don't care.

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:28.150
To protect Hachirou, I'd give 
up an eyeball or two.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:31.160
Hmph, what is everyone's problem?

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:33.980
Fine. North, right?

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.600
You watch carefully, too.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:48.310
Have the Five Treasures of Kouga really died?

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:53.070
If Hachirou said so, then yes.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:56.340
If he said so, he's right.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.320
I see...

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.740
Does it itch?

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:08.790
Hey.

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:11.060
If it itches, take it off.

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:12.220
I'll help you.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:14.170
No!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.300
Don't touch me.

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:20.900
I'm sorry.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:21.800
I didn't mean anything by it.

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:23.530
I'm sure you didn't.

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:34.990
Are you going to watch me all night?

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.530
That is correct.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:39.320
And there is a hiding place under the floor.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.270
A hiding place?

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.710
Come out only at the very end.

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:45.610
That is why they're here.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:55.480
They're late...

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.220
Is that you, Gei'in?

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:02.220
Are you back, Gei'in?

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:09.390
Forgive my impudence, 
but may I have your name?

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:13.410
Are you Suruga Dainagon?

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:20.350
Are you Suruga Dainagon?

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.440
Indeed.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:28.060
Ruler of the rich lands of 
Suruga and Tootoumi,

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.120
and the Dainagon.

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:35.510
In other words, after the 
former shogun, Lord Hidetada,

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:38.630
and the current shogun, Iemitsu-sama,

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:41.010
you are the third-most important 
in the Land of the Rising Sun.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:46.010
But also the most unfortunate.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:48.630
What... did you say?!

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:50.390
I will not forgive such words!

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.610
I am afraid that, someday,

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:04.280
your own noble neck will be 
exposed to the blade.

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:06.400
S-Silence, scum...

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:10.660
Kneel before me, so I can execute you now!

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.060
Execute me?

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:18.120
Suruga-sama, it will be you who is executed.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.900
Silence... Silence!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.170
Impudent scum!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:25.400
And your executioner

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:33.020
will be your brother, Shogun Iemitsu!

00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:35.430
What nonsense.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:40.310
Do you wish to know if it is truly nonsense?

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:45.950
You have noticed the feelings 
he has hidden in his heart.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:48.970
Who... Who are you?

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:53.870
My name is Joujin.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.010
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:27.720
Tokugawa Tadanaga.

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:31.860
Grandson of the shogun, Ieyasu, who began 
the Tokugawa's-300-year reign.

00:23:31.860 --> 00:23:36.830
He never became shogun, 
and committed seppuku.

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:37.520
<b><i>The Joujinshuu Appear</i></b>

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:39.020
Thus say the history books.
